    'body' => <<<'HTML'
<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>A supplement is a documented request to correct or add to the insurer’s estimate on the same claim. It is a normal part of many hail claims, not an unusual fight.</li>
